  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My test setup:\n- Real Height\n- Input my actual height\n- Locked Hip\nUnfortunately, even with these settings, there's a number of issues with things. Sitting cross legged results in oddities. Take note of the position of my hands (I rested them on my real life knees) and how the legs/feet are stuck in the ground.\nOld IK:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948496907863482408/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-14-14.449.png\nNew IK:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948497089220984862/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-15-24.624.png\nSitting off of the edge of my bed and letting my feet dangle, while moving my feet around results in very overdramatic movement of the models knee. Estimation of the knee and leg pose is also incredibly poor. In all the photos, I rested my hands on my actual real life knees:\nOld IK:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948498022864666694/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-16-47.261.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948498270865461279/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-17-02.858.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948498552659787806/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-17-26.278.png\nNew IK:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948498058759520297/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-15-58.249.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948498313706082334/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-16-17.154.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/948498556518559744/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-03-02_03-18-14.249.png",
